# Large / regeneratable GAN training artifacts -- not source, not needed to
# run the app. gan_lab/gpu_results/checkpoints/*.pt alone are ~287MB each
# (GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100MB), and the rest here is
# superseded or reproducible by re-running the training scripts/notebook.
# gan_lab/anti_gan_checkpoint.pt is deliberately NOT excluded -- it's small
# (~44MB) and the live dashboard's anti-GAN scan needs it to work out of
# the box after a fresh clone, without requiring a retrain first.
gan_lab/gpu_results/
gan_lab/checkpoints/
gan_lab/samples/
gan_lab/fid_eval/
gan_lab/train_all.log
